# Regression vectors for the fixes listed in REVIEW.md (expected = documented contract).
### a4-direct-high-to-low
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 35
s 2 5
s 3 -inf
s 4 inf
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@1:35.000
LOW TO_LOW@2:5.000
LOW
HIGH TO_HIGH@4:inf
### a4-direct-high-to-low-with-delay
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=10 escalate=0
